# Machine Models

This directory will contain Blender source files for industrial machinery.

## Planned Assets

- Conveyor belt system
- Industrial motors (various sizes)
- Proximity sensors
- Temperature sensors
- Control panels
- Safety barriers

## Modeling Notes

- Follow PBR workflow
- Keep polygon count reasonable (2K-5K tris)
- Use modular design where possible
- Real-world scale (1 unit = 1 meter)
